<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/4/msa@/~cl_9> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/4/msa@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/4/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/4/msa@/~cl_9> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "9" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/4/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/4/msa@/~cl_9> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/4/msa@> .
